      <title>Some 30 years on from first album, Filter leader keeps Cleveland close to his heart</title>
      <link>https://www.cleveland.com/entertainment/2026/03/some-30-years-on-from-first-album-filter-leader-keeps-cleveland-close-to-his-heart.html</link>
      <description>It's been 30 years since Filter -- formed by Richard Patrick in Cleveland after he left Nine Inch Nails -- released its hit first album, "Short Bus." The band is still going strong and still on the road promoting its latest album, 2025`s "The Algorithm," with a home town return on April 1 at the House of Blues.</description>
