      <description>Since starting to pay clubs in her native Kansas City nearly 20 years ago, Samantha Fish has released eight albums of her own, plus collaborative efforts with other artists, and earlier this year she received a Grammy Award nomination -- her second -- for her latest album, "Paper Doll." Fish plans to make a splash on April 1 at the Goodyear Theater in Akron.</description>
